=W'(\phi)D-W''(\phi)\bar\psi\psi.$ 对于 $W(\phi)=\phi^2$，这重现式 [eq:l7-superfield-square]；对于 $W(\phi)=\phi^n$，它给出 $\left.\Phi^n\right|_{\bar\theta\theta}
